  "translation": "I cidennw bolo, i ye Adonay tuusi, i ko: «Ne wotoro caman na, ne tulama kulujanw sanfɛ, Lebanon yɔrɔ-ɲɛfɛw la; ne bɛ bɛnɛ jiri janw bɛnɛ, n'a bɛrɛsu dɔw minnu ka ɲi, ne na don a daminin kɔrɔ, a nakɔ dɔgɔyɔrɔ na.»",
